"""F1 reader (Opus 5): the EXACT amendments to SPEC.md as OLD/NEW pairs.
OLD is extracted from SPEC.md by (start marker, end marker) so it is byte-exact; each start marker must occur once.
The script applies all pairs, in order, to a COPY in the scratch dir (SPEC.md is never written), checks every OLD
was found exactly once, lints the amended copy, and writes amendments_O.md (the OLD/NEW list quoted in read-O.md)."""
